// SEGURANÇA: create é admin-only (não "__disabled__") porque a criação
// legítima acontece na function createClassroom via asServiceRole — e, pela
// doc do Base44, service role assume role "admin" mas NÃO bypassa RLS.
// update/delete seguem com dono/teacher_id/admin: o rename/archive do
// professor usa update direto do cliente e continua funcionando.
{
  "name": "Classroom",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "code": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "teacher_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "teacher_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "school_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "archived": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name",
    "code",
    "teacher_id"
  ],
  "rls": {
    "read": {
      "$or": [
        {
          "created_by_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "data.teacher_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "$and": [
            {
              "user_condition": {
                "account_type": "director"
              }
            },
            {
              "data.school_id": "{{user.data.school_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "user_condition": {
            "role": "admin"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "create": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "update": {
      "$or": [
        {
          "created_by_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "data.teacher_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "user_condition": {
            "role": "admin"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "delete": {
      "$or": [
        {
          "created_by_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "data.teacher_id": "{{user.id}}"
        },
        {
          "user_condition": {
            "role": "admin"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}